            "notes": "This is where the build starts to come together, with [Stinger](item_e9d0d530-d620-4e74-a34d-38cdebfeb9a4) you're able to comfortably apply [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) onto any target in your LoS and  [Skyline Nanites](item_0b334927-da04-42d6-8dfd-96e7b6c1cd51) if its that pesky pharah you're hunting. If you can afford to keep  [Energized Bracers](item_f83a1d9e-91f8-4d2c-bd62-c673b8d9fd2e) do so, but its the first thing I'd sell to keep up with Cyber/Skyline.",
