            "created_at": "2025-09-01T06:59:00.985767+00:00",
            "notes": "Round 4 we're getting some more debuffs with [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98), we should be able to comfortably pressure the pharah off our backline and onto the ground now, with these debuffs additionally you'll be able to provide a great deal of pressure in fights. If you're having some troubles with survivability, you can either run [Reinforced Titanium](item_8ebaa7db-aedf-48ed-adc1-318cb46a3214) if they're doing ability damage or [Lock-On Shield](item_220287f8-1dc5-4a6c-9e86-c14cf970b689). If the flyer in question is still giving you problems and you couldn't afford [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98) go ahead and grab [Stratosphere Beacon](item_15bf2dc7-5161-47b0-929b-17cbb1d54182), it doesn't apply anywhere near similar pressure in teamfights, but it accomplishes the general goal of grounding the pharah/flyer.",
