            "created_at": "2025-09-01T06:59:01.203086+00:00",
            "notes": "Going into round 5 you should have established yourself as at least a threat to the flyer being targeted, giving you some space in the build to grab [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b), its just a great value item for Juno especially with [Stinger](item_e9d0d530-d620-4e74-a34d-38cdebfeb9a4) already encouraging you to pop shots at the enemy. Just follow the same logic as previous rounds, neutralize the flyer then help in the teamfights, make sure you aren't getting carried away with the dps though, you are still a support. If you can afford any of the future purples at this point go ahead and buy them.",
