            "notes": "If you've made it here it means that their flyer wasn't the one that was gonna carry their team, and it means you can transition out of solely anti air mode. Focus on your teamfights and ult building. Almost any power works here, if you're having survivability issues grab [Blink Boosts](item_9bac3119-781b-4dc0-94fa-9c293c02dc90) and [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8), if your team is playing well in your LoS [Biotech Maximizer](item_01c6dcb3-d2e2-4c57-bd21-61d7b8f939c4) could also be a good pickup, but make sure you're hitting teammates with them too. [Black Hole](item_d9edbd0b-d1e2-4103-b8d4-6e1dc8124894) would be strong into close range tanks like [Reinhardt](hero_a3b6ca2c-6cbd-43dc-bb78-a728e42fba49) or [Junker Queen](hero_4794d288-27d9-49e0-a1dd-ffe0f4de3ab1). If none of the others work [Orbital Alignment](item_0200bc1e-942e-4576-bbf7-9975d2214365) just makes your ray so so strong for free or [Torpedo Glide](item_b04180a3-c2b2-409c-959e-77e3af6bc7d8) gives pretty good cooldown redc.",
